WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.510
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.510 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 23]

02:20.200 --> 02:21.900
A group of Northern Desert killers

02:21.900 --> 02:22.820
ambushed Jiu.

02:23.200 --> 02:24.920
They chased Jiu for dozens of li

02:25.680 --> 02:28.140
until he was cornered on a cliff

02:28.140 --> 02:29.240
with no way out.

02:30.200 --> 02:32.000
I heard he was seriously injured.

02:33.260 --> 02:36.240
I guess he jumped off the cliff for the sake of dignity.

02:56.520 --> 02:58.120
I swear on General Chu's armor.

02:59.800 --> 03:00.920
I will stay alive

03:02.720 --> 03:03.640
and return the armor.

03:05.440 --> 03:06.320
Both.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.200
The armor and me.

03:11.000 --> 03:11.840
I give you my word.

03:13.620 --> 03:14.980
I will come back alive.

03:24.320 --> 03:25.000
Jiu,

03:27.120 --> 03:28.360
you liar.

03:31.320 --> 03:32.760
Why did you break your promise?

03:53.480 --> 03:53.960
Your Highness!

03:55.000 --> 03:55.520
Your Highness!

03:56.360 --> 03:56.840
Your Highness,

03:57.040 --> 03:58.120
we received anonymous news.

03:58.200 --> 03:59.280
Those killers aren't from

03:59.320 --> 04:00.080
the Northern Desert

04:00.160 --> 04:01.080
but Xiaonan Prefecture.

04:01.360 --> 04:02.360
Xiao Xun declared himself king

04:02.520 --> 04:03.800
and feared Yunzhong.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.760
So, he wanted the Northern Desert King

04:04.760 --> 04:05.400
to be a hostage.

04:15.720 --> 04:17.120
Anyone who destabilizes my state

04:20.880 --> 04:22.400
will be killed.

04:27.160 --> 04:27.840
Issue my order.

04:30.000 --> 04:31.800
All troops in Yunzhong stand ready for war.

04:34.520 --> 04:35.760
I'll make Xiao Xun

04:38.780 --> 04:40.860
pay blood for blood.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.880
Great, no corpses were found.

04:50.440 --> 04:52.800
The Northern Desert King died within this state.

04:54.200 --> 04:57.280
Chu Zhao lost her sharpest blade too.

04:58.440 --> 04:59.040
Tie Ying,

05:00.260 --> 05:01.280
what expression

05:01.280 --> 05:02.280
do you think she has now?

05:02.880 --> 05:03.760
Xie Yanlai is dead.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.680
The frontier troops will be demoralized.

05:06.260 --> 05:07.040
Your Majesty,

05:07.820 --> 05:08.500
a wise plan.

05:10.760 --> 05:11.640
Wise?

05:15.880 --> 05:17.760
That wasn't my plan.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.080
I have to say

05:20.880 --> 05:22.320
Xie Yanfang's trick

05:22.380 --> 05:23.460
to find a scapegoat

05:24.200 --> 05:25.440
was really brilliant.

05:26.400 --> 05:27.200
Are you saying...?

05:27.820 --> 05:29.700
He knew Chu Zhao would go mad.

05:30.500 --> 05:31.980
He knew she would

05:32.640 --> 05:34.000
blame me for everything.

05:34.700 --> 05:35.580
However, Chu Zhao

05:36.380 --> 05:37.740
focuses on fighting desperately

05:38.080 --> 05:40.280
against me.

05:42.320 --> 05:44.160
So, she might never realize

05:44.820 --> 05:46.100
that she's being used.

05:46.760 --> 05:47.400
Your Majesty.

05:47.960 --> 05:48.560
Your Majesty.

05:50.260 --> 05:50.840
Your Majesty,

05:51.140 --> 05:51.940
urgent report.

05:52.320 --> 05:53.480
Her Highness led frontier troops

05:53.760 --> 05:54.720
and broke through Qingyu Pass.

05:54.940 --> 05:56.220
They're heading for Xiaonan.

05:58.620 --> 05:59.860
At last, she's coming.

06:02.540 --> 06:06.170
[Xiaonan]

06:14.200 --> 06:14.800
Zhao,

06:16.140 --> 06:17.820
why bother to make such a fuss?

06:19.000 --> 06:20.320
You took your elite troops

06:20.800 --> 06:21.720
to my prefecture.

06:22.720 --> 06:24.400
Have you come to seek refuge with me?

06:25.040 --> 06:25.760
Xiao Xun,

06:26.640 --> 06:28.320
you rebelled,

06:29.360 --> 06:30.560
murdered my general,

06:30.920 --> 06:32.040
killed the enemy king,

06:32.200 --> 06:33.360
and broke the alliance.

06:34.120 --> 06:34.840
Today,

06:34.880 --> 06:36.360
as the Grand Princess of State,

06:36.600 --> 06:38.000
I'll punish the traitors!

06:38.760 --> 06:40.440
I have the late Emperor's edict.

06:41.760 --> 06:43.600
I'm the legitimate heir to the throne,

06:43.600 --> 06:44.560
favored by heaven.

06:45.240 --> 06:46.520
The real traitor

06:47.000 --> 06:48.000
remains to be seen.

06:48.880 --> 06:50.280
Faking an imperial edict

06:50.760 --> 06:51.920
is an even greater offense.

06:52.800 --> 06:53.800
Murdered your general?

06:54.880 --> 06:56.040
Killed the enemy king?

06:57.240 --> 06:58.360
You don't think

06:58.920 --> 07:00.640
I killed Xie Yanlai, do you?

07:01.800 --> 07:04.000
You always have an excuse to condemn me.

07:04.480 --> 07:05.080
Chu Zhao,

07:06.040 --> 07:07.400
for your personal revenge,

07:08.160 --> 07:09.440
you're starting a war.

07:10.200 --> 07:11.320
You killed a general

07:11.600 --> 07:12.520
and brought chaos on the frontier.

07:13.080 --> 07:15.080
How dare you say this is just an excuse?

07:16.360 --> 07:17.000
Soldiers,

07:17.680 --> 07:18.440
kill the traitors!

07:21.200 --> 07:21.880
Kill!

07:21.920 --> 07:22.560
Kill!

07:22.700 --> 07:27.240
- Kill! - Kill!

07:27.800 --> 07:28.920
Kill!

07:29.200 --> 07:30.340
Kill!

07:30.400 --> 07:34.160
Kill!

07:35.420 --> 07:42.020
Kill!

07:42.500 --> 07:44.520
Kill!

08:08.520 --> 08:09.840
Xiao Xun has been captured.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.120
You should all surrender!

08:12.600 --> 08:13.240
Deng Yi,

08:14.280 --> 08:14.960
how dare you...

08:33.120 --> 08:33.960
I didn't expect that.

08:34.920 --> 08:35.960
Deng Yi helped me win.

08:37.480 --> 08:38.640
He also made me lose.

08:39.540 --> 08:41.540
I'm the one who defeated you.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.480
From now on,

08:50.280 --> 08:51.640
you'll be the dowager.

08:52.280 --> 08:53.560
Just enjoy a great life.

08:54.040 --> 08:55.680
Oh, my silly son.

08:56.160 --> 08:57.080
A mother

08:57.440 --> 08:59.120
cares nothing for a great life.

08:59.540 --> 09:01.080
All I want is that you can

09:01.440 --> 09:02.400
stay safe.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.720
This is the talisman I got for you.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.000
You will stay healthy

09:07.480 --> 09:08.400
and watch me

09:08.400 --> 09:09.760
rise to a position

09:10.160 --> 09:11.480
second only to the Emperor.

09:12.280 --> 09:13.720
Chu Zhao had the talisman

09:13.760 --> 09:14.720
sent to me.

09:15.020 --> 09:16.060
She's threatening me.

09:17.200 --> 09:19.840
Then what will you do, My Lord?

09:21.400 --> 09:22.360
What can I do?

09:23.280 --> 09:24.400
With this talisman,

09:24.920 --> 09:25.920
she's warning me

09:26.720 --> 09:28.040
that my mother is alive

09:29.440 --> 09:30.400
and she has her.

09:41.120 --> 09:42.120
Zhao,

09:44.120 --> 09:45.880
I have true feelings for you.

09:47.160 --> 09:48.400
I never meant to hurt you.

09:49.040 --> 09:49.720
Is that so?

09:52.040 --> 09:53.000
Then in my past life,

09:54.740 --> 09:56.220
who strangled me

09:58.140 --> 10:00.020
with white silk?

10:04.020 --> 10:05.420
Your... Your past life?

10:12.660 --> 10:13.320
Yes.

10:15.400 --> 10:16.760
I lived once before.

10:19.100 --> 10:20.620
I died too.

10:23.540 --> 10:25.340
You killed me.

10:27.400 --> 10:28.160
Why?

10:28.860 --> 10:30.660
Why did you do this to my clan?

10:31.260 --> 10:32.780
Why did you do this to me?

10:33.140 --> 10:34.060
Why?

10:43.860 --> 10:45.140
Are you scared?

10:48.460 --> 10:49.380
In my past life,

10:50.380 --> 10:51.740
when you massacred my clan

10:52.800 --> 10:54.600
and cut off my father's head,

10:55.220 --> 10:56.580
you weren't this cowardly.

10:58.240 --> 10:59.120
What past life?

10:59.620 --> 11:00.820
This is ridiculous.

11:01.540 --> 11:03.160
How could anyone be reborn?

11:04.100 --> 11:04.660
Zhao,

11:05.500 --> 11:06.860
that must be a dream.

11:07.540 --> 11:08.400
You can't hate me

11:08.400 --> 11:09.680
for an illusory dream.

11:10.140 --> 11:10.640
Zhao.

11:10.640 --> 11:11.400
It wasn't a dream.

11:12.980 --> 11:14.220
It was a purgatory

11:14.260 --> 11:15.460
I truly experienced.

11:17.020 --> 11:18.480
Illusory?

11:21.760 --> 11:23.080
My pain was real.

11:24.400 --> 11:26.240
My father's blood was real.

11:27.660 --> 11:28.240
Zhao.

11:28.760 --> 11:30.000
It was true

11:30.020 --> 11:32.180
that all my clansmen suffered!

11:34.380 --> 11:34.900
Zhao.

11:48.100 --> 11:49.900
You never meant to hurt me?

11:54.800 --> 11:56.440
You hated me badly

11:57.640 --> 11:59.000
and wanted my father dead.

11:59.100 --> 11:59.740
No.

11:59.980 --> 12:01.460
You wanted my clan dead.

12:14.140 --> 12:15.300
You only love the throne,

12:16.100 --> 12:16.860
power,

12:18.100 --> 12:19.140
and yourself.

12:20.500 --> 12:21.740
Go to the underground

12:23.140 --> 12:24.580
with your hypocrisy.

12:39.660 --> 12:40.400
Xiao Xun,

12:41.540 --> 12:42.520
for all the civilians

12:43.480 --> 12:45.440
who suffered because of you...

12:50.320 --> 12:51.360
For my father.

12:53.120 --> 12:54.080
For Jiu.

12:56.640 --> 12:57.960
And for me.

12:59.000 --> 12:59.520
Xiao Xun,

13:01.660 --> 13:03.160
you must die.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.280
Xie Yanlai

13:13.960 --> 13:15.200
wasn't killed...

13:17.280 --> 13:18.520
In the third year of Xingping,

13:19.280 --> 13:20.800
Xiao Xun, the Prince of Xiaonan,

13:21.660 --> 13:24.080
got General Xie Yanlai killed.

13:24.540 --> 13:25.600
He colluded with enemies,

13:25.960 --> 13:27.440
trying to ruin the State of Chu!

13:28.480 --> 13:30.280
As the Grand Princess,

13:31.960 --> 13:34.800
I'm executing him to serve justice!

13:36.080 --> 13:38.800
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

13:38.840 --> 13:41.960
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

13:43.320 --> 13:46.440
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

13:47.720 --> 13:50.480
♪I'm my own pawn♪

13:50.520 --> 13:53.800
♪I sigh at my fate♪

13:54.800 --> 13:59.800
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

14:02.280 --> 14:05.640
♪All the sand is washed away♪

14:08.160 --> 14:12.160
♪An old dream fades♪

14:14.300 --> 14:19.520
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

14:20.100 --> 14:22.760
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

14:22.980 --> 14:26.020
♪I take a risk at every step♪

14:26.060 --> 14:31.180
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

14:31.500 --> 14:34.420
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

14:34.460 --> 14:37.140
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

14:37.620 --> 14:40.620
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

14:41.340 --> 14:46.480
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

14:46.480 --> 14:47.360
You picked the wrong side.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.360
A loser like me

14:50.320 --> 14:51.160
won't argue.

14:51.960 --> 14:52.920
You may die with ease.

14:54.200 --> 14:55.280
Your mother is innocent.

14:56.200 --> 14:57.240
I'll take care of her.

15:01.240 --> 15:02.240
Your Highness, I beg you

15:04.040 --> 15:05.800
not to tell her what becomes of me.

15:07.080 --> 15:13.600
♪I follow my destined path♪

15:14.880 --> 15:15.360
All right.

15:15.360 --> 15:19.180
♪All the sand is washed away♪

15:20.280 --> 15:25.040
♪An old dream fades♪

15:26.340 --> 15:28.960
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

15:28.960 --> 15:30.160
Your Highness,

15:31.760 --> 15:34.400
thank you!

15:34.940 --> 15:38.440
♪I take a risk at every step♪

15:38.640 --> 15:41.240
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

15:41.240 --> 15:41.760
The Xiao Clan

15:42.440 --> 15:43.880
will be reduced to commoners

15:44.640 --> 15:45.520
and exiled to the frontier.

15:49.420 --> 15:55.040
♪The play begins♪

15:55.040 --> 15:58.240
♪No return is expected♪

15:58.240 --> 16:00.300
♪The flame is gone♪

16:00.300 --> 16:02.820
♪Whether we win or lose♪

16:02.820 --> 16:06.470
[Xiaonan]

16:07.260 --> 16:12.240
♪I hold the reins♪

16:27.020 --> 16:29.180
Xie Yanlai

16:29.680 --> 16:31.160
wasn't killed...

16:34.600 --> 16:35.080
Your Highness.

16:38.240 --> 16:38.880
Your Highness,

16:39.760 --> 16:40.520
what's wrong?

16:41.260 --> 16:42.500
Before Xiao Xun died,

16:45.200 --> 16:46.720
he said he didn't kill Jiu.

16:47.900 --> 16:48.460
Le,

16:49.760 --> 16:51.000
is it possible that...?

16:51.160 --> 16:52.400
That traitor was still deceitful

16:52.400 --> 16:53.160
even before dying.

16:53.500 --> 16:54.780
How could you believe him?

17:00.000 --> 17:01.480
But I feel something is not right.

17:02.520 --> 17:03.200
Your Highness,

17:03.800 --> 17:04.760
you're overthinking.

17:05.220 --> 17:06.620
Shall we rest early tonight?

17:06.980 --> 17:07.620
Let me help you.

17:11.920 --> 17:12.400
Your Highness,

17:12.760 --> 17:13.680
Mr. Zhu is out there

17:13.820 --> 17:14.620
with a report to make.

17:15.440 --> 17:16.120
Show him in.

17:23.800 --> 17:24.760
Greetings.

17:26.120 --> 17:27.640
You asked me to investigate

17:27.640 --> 17:28.760
the Wangcheng case.

17:29.000 --> 17:29.920
We found

17:29.920 --> 17:31.120
a suspicious merchant

17:31.640 --> 17:32.360
named Yu Shang.

17:32.920 --> 17:33.480
Go on.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.120
He runs a small business

17:35.480 --> 17:37.240
with little contact with big merchants.

17:37.520 --> 17:38.640
But he's very friendly.

17:39.480 --> 17:40.560
Many people in town

17:40.720 --> 17:41.680
remember him.

17:45.840 --> 17:47.200
When Yu Shang left the Capital,

17:47.460 --> 17:48.740
he was holding a bottle of wine,

17:49.320 --> 17:50.960
known as "Immortal Wine".

17:51.680 --> 17:53.340
During those days, we searched

17:53.380 --> 17:54.640
all the taverns and teahouses.

17:54.980 --> 17:56.180
We even checked the banquets

17:56.340 --> 17:57.100
of big clans.

17:57.760 --> 17:58.840
It seemed an impossible job.

17:59.720 --> 18:00.480
But we succeeded.

18:01.480 --> 18:02.440
Those days, Yu Shang

18:02.440 --> 18:03.840
went to some taverns.

18:04.140 --> 18:05.060
In one of the taverns,

18:05.260 --> 18:06.260
Liang Qiang was there.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.560
More importantly,

18:08.000 --> 18:09.560
a waiter witnessed

18:09.960 --> 18:11.080
Yu Shang meeting Xie Yanfang

18:11.080 --> 18:11.960
in a private room

18:12.420 --> 18:14.020
on the second floor of Lianchi House.

18:16.820 --> 18:17.940
Xie Yanfang?

18:18.740 --> 18:19.860
Maybe that was a coincidence.

18:20.500 --> 18:22.140
We're also carefully investigating

18:22.380 --> 18:23.620
other guests who were there.

18:23.940 --> 18:25.280
But too much time has passed.

18:26.100 --> 18:26.940
We can't recover all details.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.240
Not a coincidence.

18:33.140 --> 18:35.040
He was involved with two key figures,

18:35.100 --> 18:36.680
Yu Shang and Liang Qiang.

18:38.240 --> 18:39.480
It couldn't be a coincidence.

18:41.040 --> 18:42.280
I'm afraid everything was...

18:49.840 --> 18:50.620
That was

18:50.640 --> 18:51.640
a really marvelous plan.

18:52.200 --> 18:53.560
Xiao Xun and Deng Yi are dead.

18:53.940 --> 18:54.980
So is Xie Yanlai.

18:55.800 --> 18:57.440
Now, the Grand Princess stands alone.

18:57.960 --> 18:58.560
No threat.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.720
You only need to seize her command

19:00.720 --> 19:01.760
of the frontier troops.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.520
And His Majesty trusts you.

19:04.500 --> 19:05.580
Your position is secure,

19:06.380 --> 19:08.020
as the ruler of the world.

19:08.860 --> 19:09.820
For me,

19:10.580 --> 19:12.180
controlling the game is what matters

19:13.580 --> 19:15.660
more than being the ruler of the world.

19:16.680 --> 19:17.480
Only those

19:17.480 --> 19:18.720
blinded by hatred

19:20.620 --> 19:22.500
would fail to see

19:23.460 --> 19:24.340
such an obvious flaw.

19:25.280 --> 19:25.760
I wonder

19:25.760 --> 19:26.920
when the Grand Princess

19:26.920 --> 19:28.200
will find out

19:28.920 --> 19:30.800
that I am behind

19:32.340 --> 19:33.280
all of this.

19:34.640 --> 19:36.280
But by then,

19:37.960 --> 19:39.520
she will have no choice

19:41.680 --> 19:44.000
but to return to me.

19:49.560 --> 19:50.200
General Liang,

19:51.320 --> 19:53.080
how does it feel to be a prisoner

19:53.560 --> 19:54.120
again?

19:57.580 --> 19:58.660
What are you trying to say?

20:00.880 --> 20:01.760
Just say it.

20:02.160 --> 20:03.200
The day you got your title,

20:03.920 --> 20:05.200
did you see Xie Yanfang?

20:11.140 --> 20:11.740
I knew it.

20:12.740 --> 20:13.980
At that banquet,

20:14.600 --> 20:16.040
he toasted me from afar.

20:17.100 --> 20:17.900
Only then did I know

20:20.160 --> 20:22.200
he was the one who had been helping me

20:23.680 --> 20:24.880
in the past few years.

20:25.760 --> 20:27.400
I didn't know that before.

20:27.520 --> 20:27.840
Didn't?

20:27.840 --> 20:28.160
I...

20:28.960 --> 20:30.000
At Xinggu Pass,

20:30.220 --> 20:31.580
you let the enemy troops in

20:31.980 --> 20:33.020
so that Wangcheng was lost

20:33.480 --> 20:34.640
and your comrades died.

20:34.920 --> 20:35.880
You didn't know?

20:37.300 --> 20:38.660
You could have rejected the toast,

20:39.240 --> 20:40.080
exposed his scheme,

20:40.720 --> 20:42.240
or even have died in the battle

20:42.240 --> 20:43.040
to prove loyalty.

20:44.560 --> 20:45.520
But you chose

20:45.520 --> 20:46.600
the dirtiest way.

20:46.940 --> 20:48.900
I just wanted to make a name for myself.

20:49.780 --> 20:51.020
The Xie Clan held great power.

20:52.520 --> 20:53.500
If I rejected him...

20:53.560 --> 20:54.940
You had countless chances

20:54.960 --> 20:55.720
to turn back.

20:58.140 --> 20:59.140
But after all,

21:00.700 --> 21:01.820
you betrayed those

21:01.820 --> 21:02.860
who trusted you.

21:10.520 --> 21:11.080
Today,

21:13.160 --> 21:14.960
I'll question you for the soldiers

21:15.020 --> 21:15.660
who died unjustly.

21:17.400 --> 21:18.760
How does it feel

21:20.240 --> 21:20.940
to be promoted?

21:34.880 --> 21:36.060
Soldiers in Wangcheng

21:37.260 --> 21:38.380
never knew

21:41.420 --> 21:43.100
their comrade had betrayed them

21:43.100 --> 21:43.900
even before death.

22:11.180 --> 22:11.820
I...

22:15.920 --> 22:18.320
I've learned my lesson.

22:30.020 --> 22:31.460
Liang Qiang killed himself last night.

22:32.580 --> 22:33.540
He got what he deserved.

22:39.280 --> 22:39.760
Jiu,

22:42.040 --> 22:42.640
wait and see.

22:42.680 --> 22:44.040
I will make him

22:46.160 --> 22:48.280
pay for everything he has done.

22:53.360 --> 22:54.440
Xie Yanfang always

22:54.980 --> 22:56.000
has a backup plan.

22:57.380 --> 22:58.300
The autumn hunt is coming.

22:59.160 --> 23:00.440
He will bring this up

23:00.620 --> 23:01.740
in the court.

23:02.680 --> 23:03.600
On the day of the hunt,

23:04.580 --> 23:06.020
he will make his move.

23:06.440 --> 23:07.060
Then we should

23:07.060 --> 23:08.260
make early preparations.

23:08.960 --> 23:09.840
Your Highness...

23:10.760 --> 23:11.600
Have the Longwei Army

23:12.080 --> 23:12.800
ambush in the hunting ground.

23:15.000 --> 23:15.800
This time,

23:17.680 --> 23:19.040
I'll show him

23:19.220 --> 23:20.620
how his trap

23:22.460 --> 23:23.740
will be crushed.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.720
Mr. Deng has just died.

23:31.000 --> 23:32.000
His Majesty is young.

23:32.540 --> 23:34.940
We need to make up for the Regent's absence.

23:35.420 --> 23:36.260
I believe

23:37.140 --> 23:39.140
Mr. Xie is the best choice.

23:40.100 --> 23:42.800
- I second that. - I second that.

23:43.340 --> 23:44.420
- I second that. - I second that.

23:49.500 --> 23:51.020
Mr. Xie is virtuous and talented.

23:51.440 --> 23:52.320
He's worthy of this.

23:56.920 --> 23:58.340
Your Highness works hard to command

23:58.340 --> 23:59.240
the frontier troops.

23:59.880 --> 24:01.240
I'll work together with you

24:01.720 --> 24:03.160
to assist His Majesty.

24:04.760 --> 24:06.040
The autumn hunt is coming.

24:06.880 --> 24:07.960
Why don't we pray

24:08.400 --> 24:09.880
for His Majesty during the hunt?

24:11.000 --> 24:12.400
To hunt in this season,

24:12.640 --> 24:13.320
I'm afraid...

24:13.320 --> 24:14.440
When the late Emperor lived,

24:14.640 --> 24:16.040
he loved the autumn hunt

24:16.840 --> 24:18.720
to demonstrate our military might.

24:21.200 --> 24:22.200
What do you think, Your Highness?

24:23.280 --> 24:24.280
Mr. Xie,

24:26.100 --> 24:27.200
it's a good idea.

24:40.140 --> 24:41.320
Yu, don't be scared.

24:42.080 --> 24:43.240
When you're around,

24:43.440 --> 24:44.400
I won't be scared.

24:45.000 --> 24:46.080
Even if I'm away

24:46.320 --> 24:47.440
and you're all alone,

24:47.800 --> 24:48.840
don't be scared.

24:49.700 --> 24:51.020
Because you've grown up.

24:51.280 --> 24:52.320
You can protect yourself

24:52.940 --> 24:54.080
and you're the Emperor

24:54.080 --> 24:54.920
who protects his people.

24:55.980 --> 24:56.580
Come on, Yu.

24:57.180 --> 24:58.620
Show me how well you can hunt.

25:20.560 --> 25:22.000
Yu rides very well.

25:24.440 --> 25:25.920
But he isn't good at archery.

25:26.080 --> 25:27.720
An emperor doesn't need all skills.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.360
He just needs to keep fit.

25:30.680 --> 25:31.440
It's said you excel

25:31.440 --> 25:32.560
in riding and archery.

25:32.920 --> 25:34.120
Why don't you be his model?

25:34.720 --> 25:35.560
Since Yu was little,

25:35.880 --> 25:36.960
he has admired you.

25:37.640 --> 25:38.760
All I seek in my life

25:39.720 --> 25:40.760
is to help him become

25:40.760 --> 25:41.760
an unparalleled emperor.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.680
Whether I can be his model

25:46.280 --> 25:47.440
and whether my clan

25:47.440 --> 25:48.680
can remain unmatched...

25:49.840 --> 25:50.880
Neither of those matters.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.800
I know

25:54.140 --> 25:55.100
you care for Yu

25:55.560 --> 25:57.080
as well as our state.

25:57.760 --> 25:59.280
For the court's long-term interests,

25:59.560 --> 26:00.640
I want to issue a ban.

26:00.880 --> 26:02.040
Ban imperial in-laws from official posts.

26:03.140 --> 26:04.060
Mr. Xie,

26:04.500 --> 26:05.340
what do you think?

26:06.040 --> 26:06.560
Very good.

26:08.040 --> 26:09.360
Don't you think this is hegemony?

26:09.920 --> 26:10.800
In my heart,

26:11.100 --> 26:12.400
you will help Yu

26:13.000 --> 26:14.640
dominate the entire world.

26:15.100 --> 26:16.040
But I don't think

26:16.080 --> 26:17.040
this is hegemony.

26:17.680 --> 26:19.000
It's what you should do

26:19.040 --> 26:20.360
and what you have to do.

26:20.960 --> 26:22.440
I pledge my life

26:23.440 --> 26:25.080
to help you achieve this goal.

26:25.920 --> 26:26.880
It has never changed.

26:29.480 --> 26:30.200
In that case,

26:30.720 --> 26:32.200
why did you kill my ally?

26:41.720 --> 26:44.280
Who do you refer to? Deng Yi

26:45.600 --> 26:46.680
or Zhong Changrong?

26:48.040 --> 26:49.640
Or my brother Yanlai?

26:52.700 --> 26:53.860
Deng Yi and I fell out

26:54.880 --> 26:56.280
because of the loss of Wangcheng.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.520
Or even earlier.

26:59.280 --> 27:00.080
Because Deng Yi

27:00.080 --> 27:01.440
insisted on appointing Liang Qiang.

27:03.000 --> 27:03.920
But now it seems

27:04.740 --> 27:06.300
that Liang Qiang was your mole.

27:06.780 --> 27:07.920
So, Deng Yi

27:07.920 --> 27:08.920
was within your plan.

27:09.680 --> 27:10.240
That's right.

27:11.280 --> 27:12.280
Liang Qiang has always

27:12.280 --> 27:13.160
served me.

27:14.480 --> 27:15.640
At Xinggu Pass,

27:15.720 --> 27:17.160
if he had killed Zhong Changrong

27:17.520 --> 27:18.560
and replaced him,

27:19.100 --> 27:20.040
it would have saved me

27:20.040 --> 27:21.240
a lot of trouble.

27:21.680 --> 27:23.400
Sadly, Yanlai interfered.

27:24.520 --> 27:26.000
My foolproof plan

27:27.200 --> 27:28.600
ended in ruin.

27:30.080 --> 27:30.640
So,

27:33.040 --> 27:34.000
he had to die.

27:36.040 --> 27:37.240
Then you sent your men

27:37.280 --> 27:38.880
to kill him and the enemy king?

27:41.240 --> 27:42.400
Xiao Xun was

27:42.400 --> 27:43.240
a perfect scapegoat.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.000
Why wouldn't I?

27:46.100 --> 27:47.600
Xiao Xun killed the enemy king

27:47.600 --> 27:48.720
and my brother Yanlai.

27:48.920 --> 27:50.080
There was solid evidence.

27:51.400 --> 27:52.840
That you massacred Xiaonan

27:52.920 --> 27:54.000
to avenge Yanlai

27:54.400 --> 27:56.080
is also known to all.

27:56.560 --> 27:58.080
Now, even if you expose

27:58.080 --> 27:58.840
the truth,

28:00.340 --> 28:01.880
who would believe you?

28:04.580 --> 28:05.340
I know.

28:06.740 --> 28:07.880
Your Highness and Deng Yi

28:07.880 --> 28:09.150
only differed in politics,

28:09.640 --> 28:11.560
but you had to kill him yourself.

28:12.340 --> 28:13.180
Deep in your heart,

28:13.540 --> 28:15.180
you felt a little bit sad.

28:16.160 --> 28:17.200
But the two of you

28:17.560 --> 28:19.440
couldn't coexist in the court.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.440
So for your own good,

28:22.920 --> 28:24.600
Deng Yi had to die.

28:25.440 --> 28:26.760
Even so,

28:28.400 --> 28:30.360
you shouldn't have interfered.

28:34.320 --> 28:35.640
I was helping you.

28:37.160 --> 28:37.680
No need!

28:38.760 --> 28:39.360
Xie Yanfang,

28:39.720 --> 28:40.920
I'm not your plaything.

28:41.880 --> 28:43.000
I'm different from those

28:43.000 --> 28:43.520
you have tamed.

28:44.200 --> 28:45.140
I won't become a puppet

28:45.140 --> 28:46.420
under your control.

28:48.160 --> 28:49.640
Don't think you've won.

28:50.760 --> 28:52.000
Because this game

28:52.960 --> 28:54.560
isn't over yet.

28:56.100 --> 28:57.140
Unless I'm dead,

28:57.960 --> 28:59.160
you can never command

28:59.160 --> 29:00.640
the frontier troops.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.800
You've already lost, Your Highness.

29:07.640 --> 29:09.600
A ruler must not have weak spots.

29:10.600 --> 29:11.520
You show mercy

29:11.520 --> 29:13.280
to so many trivial people and things.

29:14.240 --> 29:15.840
You're bound to lose.

29:25.120 --> 29:25.680
Xie Yanfang,

29:26.120 --> 29:27.080
what exactly do you want

29:27.280 --> 29:28.360
from this trap of yours?

29:29.920 --> 29:31.120
The frontier troops.

29:31.480 --> 29:32.160
No way.

29:51.280 --> 29:52.320
I'm not in a hurry.

29:53.360 --> 29:55.160
Take your time to think it over.

29:56.080 --> 29:56.600
But if you

29:56.600 --> 29:57.880
insist on refusing,

29:58.520 --> 30:00.320
tomorrow, the whole world will know:

30:00.960 --> 30:02.640
"The Grand Princess was assassinated during the hunt

30:03.720 --> 30:04.640
and before death,

30:05.360 --> 30:07.520
Her Highness entrusted the Xie Clan with the military power."

30:08.480 --> 30:09.400
Xie Yanfang,

30:11.960 --> 30:13.240
you'll regret this.

30:14.360 --> 30:15.040
Regret?

30:19.400 --> 30:20.720
I won't regret anything.

30:22.040 --> 30:23.360
Nor will you.

30:25.060 --> 30:25.700
Du Qi.

30:26.120 --> 30:26.520
Here.

30:27.140 --> 30:29.180
Send Her Highness back to her tent.

30:30.240 --> 30:31.920
She must be tired.

30:51.400 --> 30:51.920
Yu,

30:52.880 --> 30:54.200
this is venison from today's hunt.

30:54.360 --> 30:55.160
Eat while it's hot.

30:56.560 --> 30:58.200
Are you going to kill Zhao?

31:04.800 --> 31:06.040
What makes you say that?

31:06.800 --> 31:07.920
I'm young,

31:08.600 --> 31:09.640
but I'm not stupid.

31:10.640 --> 31:11.720
Zhao is confined.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.760
There are unusual troop moves.

31:14.600 --> 31:15.680
Do you really think

31:16.520 --> 31:17.720
I know nothing?

31:20.800 --> 31:21.600
Your Majesty,

31:24.360 --> 31:25.920
I just want to show Her Highness

31:26.760 --> 31:27.640
that some methods

31:28.480 --> 31:29.280
just won't work.

31:30.400 --> 31:31.960
If you can persuade Her Highness

31:32.000 --> 31:32.960
to give me the Token,

31:34.200 --> 31:35.000
I promise you.

31:35.840 --> 31:37.560
She will be safe.

31:39.160 --> 31:40.280
She's my sister!

31:40.960 --> 31:42.280
The Grand Princess of State!

31:42.880 --> 31:43.240
You...

31:43.760 --> 31:44.120
You...

31:45.040 --> 31:46.840
Are you forcing me to make my choice?

31:47.920 --> 31:48.880
You're wrong.

31:51.840 --> 31:54.040
It's Her Highness who will make her own choice.

31:54.840 --> 31:55.960
To keep the military power

31:58.200 --> 31:59.760
or to keep alive.

32:09.560 --> 32:11.400
I await your decision, Your Majesty.

32:37.680 --> 32:38.200
Zhao,

32:38.640 --> 32:39.720
I brought you some pastries.

32:40.400 --> 32:40.960
Yu?

32:41.800 --> 32:42.640
Why are you here?

32:43.240 --> 32:44.000
It's cold at night.

32:44.120 --> 32:45.320
You should have worn more.

32:45.920 --> 32:46.440
Zhao,

32:47.000 --> 32:47.960
are you hurt?

32:48.800 --> 32:49.480
I'm fine.

32:49.880 --> 32:50.600
Don't worry.

32:52.160 --> 32:53.600
I don't want you to be confined.

32:54.560 --> 32:55.520
Let's give the Token

32:56.240 --> 32:57.360
to Uncle Yanfang.

33:00.880 --> 33:01.480
Yu,

33:02.040 --> 33:03.520
do you know the meaning

33:03.840 --> 33:04.720
of the Frontier Troops Token?

33:05.720 --> 33:08.000
Xie Yanfang represents the Xie Family.

33:09.600 --> 33:10.960
If he seizes the military power

33:11.340 --> 33:12.540
and allows his clan to dominate,

33:13.200 --> 33:14.400
it will be a total disaster.

33:15.040 --> 33:16.360
I just want you to live.

33:17.000 --> 33:17.880
He promised me.

33:18.920 --> 33:20.480
As long as you meet his conditions...

33:21.360 --> 33:22.040
Don't worry.

33:23.240 --> 33:24.440
We'll both be all right.

33:25.360 --> 33:26.560
Someone will come to save us.

33:27.680 --> 33:29.400
Who are you waiting for, Your Highness?

34:06.800 --> 34:08.040
You guessed right.

34:10.000 --> 34:10.880
The Longwei Army

34:11.280 --> 34:12.640
is invincible.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.180
They live incognito

34:14.180 --> 34:15.320
and kill without a trace.

34:16.140 --> 34:16.920
Sadly,

34:17.400 --> 34:18.880
since you became the Grand Princess

34:19.440 --> 34:21.320
and the Longwei Army turned up,

34:22.120 --> 34:23.840
I have been investigating them.

34:25.660 --> 34:27.420
It took me a lot of time.

34:29.280 --> 34:30.400
But now,

34:34.320 --> 34:36.120
I know who they are.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.360
So, I cut off their heads

34:39.360 --> 34:40.760
one after another

34:41.600 --> 34:43.080
and took off the yellow ribbons

34:43.080 --> 34:45.080
as proof of their identities.

34:52.780 --> 34:54.580
You recognize this, don't you?

35:05.160 --> 35:06.520
You monster!

35:09.080 --> 35:09.560
Zhao!

35:09.560 --> 35:09.920
You...

35:10.380 --> 35:11.540
You will pay for this!

35:12.420 --> 35:13.260
Me?

35:14.380 --> 35:16.260
They all died because of you.

35:17.600 --> 35:18.480
Not just them.

35:19.420 --> 35:21.020
If you really disobey,

35:22.120 --> 35:23.880
I'll also massacre Cangmu Stronghold

35:24.680 --> 35:26.200
and bring you the heads

35:26.200 --> 35:27.320
of Xiaoman and her men.

35:28.520 --> 35:29.680
What do you say?

35:32.900 --> 35:33.580
Your Highness,

35:34.500 --> 35:35.380
Just admit your defeat.

35:35.860 --> 35:37.660
Why don't you just kill me?

35:38.560 --> 35:39.560
Then you will have

35:40.300 --> 35:40.980
the court

35:41.500 --> 35:42.860
and the frontier troops!

35:58.980 --> 35:59.860
If you die,

36:02.460 --> 36:03.940
Yu will be very sad.

36:17.980 --> 36:18.780
Anyway,

36:20.520 --> 36:22.720
I'm waiting for you

36:23.780 --> 36:25.420
to surrender of your own will.

37:08.460 --> 37:10.020
The frontier troops and Mr. Zhong

37:12.680 --> 37:14.160
only obey this token.

38:01.020 --> 38:02.460
This dagger is coated with Golden Finch Venom.

38:02.980 --> 38:04.660
Xie Yanfang, you'll die!

38:13.860 --> 38:15.740
Well, you've grown.

38:17.220 --> 38:18.680
You've even learned to use poison.

38:19.600 --> 38:21.600
There's no antidote for this poison.

38:22.220 --> 38:23.000
Xie Yanfang,

38:23.460 --> 38:24.820
you're going to die!

38:25.780 --> 38:27.260
You would sacrifice your own life

38:27.300 --> 38:28.620
just to kill me?

38:28.620 --> 38:29.140
Yes!

38:30.460 --> 38:32.020
I want you dead!

38:40.780 --> 38:41.620
Zhao, run!

38:43.040 --> 38:43.560
Your Majesty.

38:43.600 --> 38:44.280
I order you

38:44.560 --> 38:45.480
to drop your weapons!

39:00.900 --> 39:03.020
This breaks my heart.

39:08.040 --> 39:09.080
Seize her.

39:11.120 --> 39:12.480
Dead or alive.

39:13.060 --> 39:14.020
- Yes! - Yes!

39:15.460 --> 39:16.100
Your Majesty.

39:56.160 --> 39:57.000
Stop!

39:57.160 --> 39:57.760
Don't run!

39:59.280 --> 39:59.880
Stop!

40:00.180 --> 40:00.900
Catch her!

40:00.900 --> 40:01.580
Stop!

40:02.920 --> 40:03.520
Hurry!

40:04.040 --> 40:04.720
Stop running!

40:05.320 --> 40:05.960
Stop!

40:32.520 --> 40:37.120
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

40:37.400 --> 40:39.880
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

40:39.920 --> 40:43.960
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

40:46.200 --> 40:48.320
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

40:48.400 --> 40:50.360
♪And roars in the blaze♪

40:50.440 --> 40:53.680
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

40:53.840 --> 40:56.080
♪Fate imprisons me♪

40:56.240 --> 41:01.040
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

41:01.040 --> 41:05.240
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

41:05.240 --> 41:09.520
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

41:09.520 --> 41:14.960
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

41:14.960 --> 41:16.920
♪With no fear of the distance♪

41:16.920 --> 41:20.640
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

41:20.640 --> 41:25.080
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

41:25.080 --> 41:30.440
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

41:30.440 --> 41:34.040
♪My new pride♪

41:48.840 --> 41:51.720
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

41:51.720 --> 41:54.240
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

41:54.240 --> 41:56.600
♪Amidst the chaos♪

41:56.600 --> 42:00.880
♪I'll always be with you♪

42:02.320 --> 42:04.440
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

42:04.520 --> 42:06.480
♪And roars in the blaze♪

42:06.560 --> 42:09.800
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

42:09.960 --> 42:12.200
♪Fate imprisons me♪

42:12.360 --> 42:17.160
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

42:17.160 --> 42:21.360
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

42:21.360 --> 42:25.640
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

42:25.640 --> 42:31.080
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

42:31.080 --> 42:33.040
♪With no fear of the distance♪

42:33.040 --> 42:36.760
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

42:36.760 --> 42:41.200
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

42:41.200 --> 42:46.560
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

42:46.560 --> 42:50.160
♪My new pride♪
